@ExcelReportManager.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5151

### Get sample sales data
# @name sampleData
GET {{ExcelReportManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/sample-data

### Export sales data to Excel file (.xlsx)
POST {{ExcelReportManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/export
Content-Type: application/json

